ence-based treatment protocols for managing swallowing dysfunction in acute stroke patients.", "GESTIÓN DEL CENTRO:Gestión del centro refers to the management practices within healthcare facilities that impact patient care and quality indicators.", "INDICADORES DE CALIDAD:\"INDICADORES DE CALIDAD\" refers to metrics utilized to evaluate the quality of care delivered in healthcare environments. These indicators are particularly significant in the context of dysphagia management, as they help ensure that patients receive appropriate and effective care. Overall, \"indicadores de calidad\" serve as essential tools for assessing the quality of healthcare services and patient care across various medical settings.", "DIETAS DE FÁCIL DEGLUCIÓN:Dietas de fácil deglución are specialized diets designed for patients with swallowing difficulties, ensuring safe and adequate nutrition."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}